2025-04-11 11:53:11.418  INFO 27784 --- [nio-9098-exec-2] c.g.api.config.HttpRequestLoggingFilter  : 
Response(500): {&quot;code&quot;:500,&quot;status&quot;:&quot;500 INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR&quot;,&quot;message&quot;:&quot;Access forbidden&quot;}
</code></pre>
